{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35830","headline":"旅馆秋夕 · 李咸用","name":"旅馆秋夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牢落生涯在水乡，只思归去泛沧浪。\n秋风萤影随高柳，夜雨蛬声上短墙。\n百岁易爲成荏苒，丹霄谁肯借梯航。\n若教名路无知己，匹马尘中是自忙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}